Information used to fulfil orders
We collect order information including your name, email, delivery address and purchased items to process payment, fulfil orders and provide support. We retain an order address snapshot with each order. Information you send to support is used to handle your request.

Payments
Stripe collects payment information on its hosted checkout page. Payment status and transaction identifiers are used to reconcile your order. Do not send card information by email.

Cookies and preferences
The storefront uses an HttpOnly cart cookie to associate your browser with a shopping cart. It also stores a display theme preference when you choose one.

