Shopping with TeeBravo
These terms apply to purchases through {{storefront_url}}. Review the selected product, color, size and quantity before placing your order.

Prices and payment
Prices are in US dollars. Item charges, shipping and applicable taxes are presented before payment. Payment is processed through Stripe hosted checkout.

Shipping and returns
Our Shipping Policy and Returns & Refunds policy describe processing, transit estimates, delivery restrictions, return eligibility, fees and refund timing. Read them before purchasing.

